403	    /**
404	     * Part-settle an OPEN claim: split the amount off it, as {@link #split(String, String, Long, BigDecimal)}, and
405	     * settle the new claim at once, as {@link #changeStatus(String, String, Long, ClaimStatus)} (PENDING instead when
406	     * the clerk limit says so). The four-eyes rules and the proof rule are judged on the original claim as it stood
407	     * before the split; the new claim's opener (the user) may still settle it. A refused split or settle refuses the
408	     * whole action: nothing changes.
409	     */
410	    @Transactional
